Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:02.98,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:05.48,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.65,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Whoa, awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:11.90,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,I-I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:16.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You just have to store up spirit, hone it, \Ngive it a "hiyah," and then go "bang!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:19.93,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Man, I'm surprised you pulled \Nit off based on that, Clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:22.53,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:24.72,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Do you want to learn how to use it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:27.54,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,No need to be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.24,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:33.29,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,You just store up spirit, hone it, give \Nit a "gyuwawah," and then go "boom!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.29,0:00:33.87,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:35.01,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,That's not what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:36.34,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.44,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Dragon Smash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:53.29,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:56.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, this is what Dragon Smash \Nis supposed to look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:57.45,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:00:59.03,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Clay's was so wimpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:02.31,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,You're really amazing, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.38,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,It took me so many days to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Everyone, get away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:05.79,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:13.30,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:15.81,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,This is my battle to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:17.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.10,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Th-There are two Sophies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.99,0:01:25.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:27.10,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,A duplication technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:30.11,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Dragon Smash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:37.60,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What {\i1}was{\i0} that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:38.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:53.22,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,I look in your eyes, and I'm met with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:57.77,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,A brand-new me and dream
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.81,0:02:10.52,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Bravery? Naturally?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:13.11,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Polar opposites within the heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.78,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,But, you know, wanting to have both
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:18.41,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,That's the saga of human nature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:20.97,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't mind me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:23.91,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Go ahead, and so on, you know the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:26.17,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,A little more? Wait, even harder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:29.08,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Going overboard much?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:31.09,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Those selfish emotions deep down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.67,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Bringing them to light is \Nwhat friendship's about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.68,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Spending adolescence duking it out with pals
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:39.93,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,I don't wanna lose
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:43.23,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,We're off to the cutting edge moment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:47.06,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Fight with best friends, and leave no regrets
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:52.02,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,You should laugh, since \Nyou look best with a smile
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:57.65,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,On the ropes?! No matter \Nwhat we face, et cetera
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:03:00.66,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Just sit back and enjoy it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:07.85,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Whatever may come, I'll \Nbe here to protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:18.46,sign_4627_53_Episode_11,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,471)}{\3c&HC6D1E4&}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:18.46,sign_4627_54_The_Sophie_Serie,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,471)\pos(475,299.667)}The Sophie Series (Part 1)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:29.68,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:34.06,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,Une must have failed her mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:36.64,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Yo, you can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:40.80,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,What a pain! Let's just go in guns blazing,\N and kill everyone in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.49,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,C'mon, it's killing time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:45.59,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Une.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.59,0:03:48.08,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Did you find anyone cute worth killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.20,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:54.99,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,This was an undercover scouting mission, \Nin order to assess the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:57.31,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,In that regard, it was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:59.26,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,You really did fail the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:02.34,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,Your lack of proof just confirms it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.49,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,Une can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:04.84,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,So useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:06.05,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Cinq.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.35,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,You have permission to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.39,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:15.27,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Time to destroy Trois!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.73,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:19.99,Class - Top,Trois,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.92,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,So, what was the outcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:23.15,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I had them teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:24.34,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:25.91,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Be a little clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.61,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,It's hard to explain with just words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:30.31,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:39.38,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Transmitting empirical data through\N mucosal contact is certainly useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:40.88,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Deux.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:41.63,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:43.76,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:44.41,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:46.14,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,I said it hurts, jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.09,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Come here, Trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:50.89,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,You too, Cinq.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.02,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Huh? What was your goal here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:04.40,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Like I said, I had them teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.90,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Dragon Smash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:09.36,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Dragon Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.52,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,You know this isn't our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.87,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Totally not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:18.96,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,What we were commanded to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.79,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Assassination! Assassination!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:24.31,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Yes. You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:41.59,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What are you about to show us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.44,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Just be quiet and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:45.81,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:55.54,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Eliza, this is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:59.12,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,It's still a prototype,\Nbut it looks like it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:01.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So, which part of that was impressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:04.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,All it did was fire off some \Nstored-up spirit over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.39,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I don't need the opinion of a superorganism
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:08.43,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,who can hone and store his spirit\N all by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:11.39,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,That's hard for us regular human beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.62,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's hard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:13.43,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:16.61,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,By honing spirit and charging \Nit up into these cartridges,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.75,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,now anyone can activate it at \Nany time that they see fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:20.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:25.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.50,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:35.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}you{\i0} want to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:41.38,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,How to make babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:43.28,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.30,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You know that's not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.62,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:48.92,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,How I can kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:53.18,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.35,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Time to die, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sure. Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.79,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,I can't kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:08.99,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Do a better job teaching me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:10.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:13.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But if I actually teach you,\N I'll end up dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:14.69,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:18.54,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Kill me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:20.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:23.67,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:24.46,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:27.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,S-Sophie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:29.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:32.47,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Just when we were getting to the good part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:35.30,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm the one you're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:38.46,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Well, bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:42.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,How many does that make?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.23,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,First, the one with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:47.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,After that, a club, then a spear...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:48.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So this is the fourth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:54.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Here, open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think is \Nthe deal with those girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:03.49,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but they're good learners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:06.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're really passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.30,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call it passion...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:10.72,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Do you think they're Sophie's sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:13.20,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,They should all just enroll in the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:14.59,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Hold on, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.19,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Let's think this through a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:18.63,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Don't you find it at least a little weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:19.14,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:22.48,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You've become a lot like Blade lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:25.44,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,In your lack of common sense, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:26.52,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:31.40,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Do you have anything to say about the \Nunusual situation we find ourselves in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.13,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,She's gone into Empress mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.22,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.66,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.16,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:38.91,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:41.25,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,From an outside perspective, \Nit seems clear to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:45.25,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,that those girls are seriously \Ntrying to kill Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:49.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I do the same thing when \NI attack him during lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.45,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:52.42,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,If anything, I'd finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:56.22,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Don't forget that I'm the \None who will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:58.26,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,What?! Um, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:08:59.99,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:02.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Lay off her already. \NCan't you see that she's scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Am I being scolded by Blade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:05.77,sign_13071_177_Ba_dump,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(588,164.333)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:08.97,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Um, I didn't mean it in \Nthe way that you all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.93,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Pretending to be Sophie to get close to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.58,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Attacking him with clear murderous intent...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:13.53,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,That has to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:16.16,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Um, give me a second here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:21.54,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,The most probable conclusion we can \Narrive at from all of these facts is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,that Blade is being targeted by assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:29.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.11,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.11,0:09:36.76,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I just found out that none of you \Nrealized that they were assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:39.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait! D-Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:41.64,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,We knew all along! We really did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:43.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I had it figured out from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:45.67,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Act a little scared about it, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:48.27,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Is someone after your life, Parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.70,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:52.27,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll protect Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:03.26,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,You all failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:04.19,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,It's me next!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:05.96,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,I'll destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.81,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Can I destroy him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:07.86,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Shut your trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:09.29,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,You're giving me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.99,0:10:12.31,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,I haven't failed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:13.29,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:15.80,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,The lack of proof just confirms it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:18.76,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,The Great Hero couldn't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:23.66,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,That means I can kill him next time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:24.86,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy, destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:25.81,Class - Top,Une,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:25.81,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.53,0:10:30.90,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Wasting unnecessary energy\N will only shorten your lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:32.29,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Une.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:36.27,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Deux. Trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:37.83,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Quatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:40.45,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Cinq.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:45.32,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,It's up to you to show everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:49.04,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,that an Artificial Great Hero can \Nsurpass even the Great Hero himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:56.10,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Kill the Great Hero Blade, \Nand prove the validity of our research.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.42,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:03.06,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,That is the sole reason that \Nwe were brought to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:09.32,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,We're the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.13,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Is that you, Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:30.04,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:31.99,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Please deactivate your stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:34.77,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It makes it difficult to \Ndetect you with my sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:37.03,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't want to wake Blade up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:39.05,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Are you worried about Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:40.05,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:42.48,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I am always by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:47.06,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Would you like to sleep next to him as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:49.84,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Now is your chance to do so\N as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:51.06,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.02,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Please leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.31,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I will protect Master with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:59.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can to protect Blade, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:01.39,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Even if it means death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.49,0:12:10.51,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:12.54,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You can't kill Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.46,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.00,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,No, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:20.21,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,That is what we were commanded to do, \Nand the only purpose of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:25.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The Artificial Great Hero Project was \Nabandoned, with me as the final subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:29.72,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The modifications you received did \Nnot follow the proper procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:32.98,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That must have had a considerable \Nimpact on your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.29,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:36.89,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,We have very short lifespan,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.89,0:12:38.23,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:42.66,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Instead of using the limited time\N left to you to obey commands,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.66,0:12:45.49,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,can't you live as humans, \Nand spend it in the light of day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:47.20,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Our orders are absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.12,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,If you want to stop us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.74,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,There's only one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.58,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Deep down, I'm sure you've realized it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.06,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:19.73,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,In our world, where the \Nlight of day does not reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:34.04,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie is pint-sized today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:36.32,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Cinq!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:36.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.21,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,My name is Cinq!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.55,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Not Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:41.51,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,So they have their own names.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:45.13,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I believe that Cinq is an ancient lost word
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:47.34,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,that signifies the number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:49.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Are there only five of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:52.26,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Is it okay for you to tell us that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:53.60,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,It wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:58.10,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think she could have \Npretended to be Sophie if she tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:13:59.70,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Forget I said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:01.54,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Or else I'll destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:01.54,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:02.23,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I forgot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:03.90,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:08.57,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,But I'm still gonna destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:12.74,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.43,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Stick to the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:15.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know I should!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:21.09,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:27.51,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Not even a superorganism \Ncan withstand that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:31.60,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:34.51,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:35.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,C'mon, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:37.62,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How long are you going to stay dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:39.90,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,He finally woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:43.36,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master won every exercise \Nthat took place in virtual reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.28,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,He is unaccustomed to dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:47.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Where's Cinq?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:48.30,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,She left already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,In an extremely good mood, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:54.31,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I don't think she realized she had \Nbeen led into virtual reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:57.12,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,So, if she's convinced that she \Nkilled Mr. Superorganism,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.07,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,our plan is a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:00.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I just hope she doesn't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:01.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.08,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If she does...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:06.87,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:09.00,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:10.93,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Lemme destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:11.57,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,I knew that's how she'd react!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.11,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:14.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Whoa, she's pissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:17.90,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Academy Building No. 2 is at 30% damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:20.41,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Any more damage carries the risk of collapse,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:23.69,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,so I propose that we relocate to Building \NNo. 3, which has been fully evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:25.20,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, tell {\i1}her{\i0} that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:27.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm sure she wouldn't listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.28,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,I can kill him, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:32.82,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:39.12,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,I'm here to kill you, so stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:41.25,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.70,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I will proceed to steer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:44.21,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:50.72,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Yo momma's got a big ol' outie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:52.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.77,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,It is a phrase used to taunt \Nothers in a lost ancient language.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:58.64,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, its meaning has \Nbeen deleted from my records.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:02.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:05.53,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:06.90,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's up to all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:08.17,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:09.86,Class- Default,Karen,0,0,0,,But, Altia...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:12.61,Class- Default,Miriam,0,0,0,,Are we really strong enough to defeat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:14.98,Class- Default,Levia,0,0,0,,We messed up during our last exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:16.49,Class- Default,Simone,0,0,0,,Can we really do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:17.94,Class- Default,Altia,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:19.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:21.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's okay if you don't want to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.61,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,They're on the same level as Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:25.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Launch your spells at them, \Nand don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:26.25,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:28.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.47,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:54.68,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, you can also use magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hm? A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:59.00,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Now is your chance to take them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.52,0:17:01.73,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What? That wasn't enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.32,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You'd better stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.58,0:17:09.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.70,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.39,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,That is a black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:17.09,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I propose that we withdraw immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.44,0:17:18.60,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hold out for ten seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:38.28,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,You think it's over? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.79,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:44.02,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Once a black hole has formed, \Nit will not die out by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:44.91,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.25,Class- Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Altia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:06.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:09.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ten. Nine. Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:11.36,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Seven. Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.61,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Five. Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:16.54,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Three... Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:18.61,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,One...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You did well, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:33.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:14.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:19.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're supposed to cut \Nthem like rabbits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Did I get it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:23.22,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're right about the rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.94,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,But wrong about how you cut them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:28.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm not supposed to use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.23,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Any casualities?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:34.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah, no one died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.25,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,A few people were injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:38.66,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,but it's okay, since Claire \Nhealed them in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:40.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,And I just got a few scrapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.24,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:44.24,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sorry for causing so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:47.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We're all fine with it, so no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:52.14,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Can you tell me about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.55,0:19:57.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Those girls... are me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:20:02.62,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Specimens created with the same cloning \Ntechnology, with further modifications...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:06.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,and successfully manifested \NArtificial Great Hero powers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.59,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,after receiving implants \Nof the rare metal Heronium.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:13.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,They've been given numbers, \Nso I feel like that must be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.56,0:20:16.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You mean the Artificial Great Hero Project?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:20.39,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was rescued by the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:24.61,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,but those girls didn't \Nhave anyone to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:29.82,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I met you at this academy, \Nand made friends with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.25,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You were my salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're the one who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:38.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You've suffered so much, all because \Nof the Great Hero's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:41.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,And yet you forgave me, the Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:43.39,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:45.87,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I take pride in these powers of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:48.01,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I never once resented you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:51.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I want to be friends with them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.01,0:20:56.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest suggested that all five of \Nthem should enroll in this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:57.78,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:20:58.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:04.64,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The Artificial Great Heroes were born to \Ndefeat the Great Hero... that is, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.64,0:21:08.20,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Their sole purpose in life is to surpass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:12.05,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was rescued before any \Nneural modifications,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:14.21,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,so I wasn't programmed as such...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:17.02,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,but those girls can't disobey their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:19.04,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:23.66,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The sunny disposition that \Nbrings a smile to your face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:29.41,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,As well as the heroic sense of justice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.41,0:22:34.58,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,They may be a part of me, \Nbut that's not all there is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:37.28,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,That image of me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.28,0:22:40.00,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Has taken on a life of its own
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:42.67,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:45.09,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Won't you be friends with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.09,0:22:49.78,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Let's shake hands, another self of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:53.20,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The wounds we cannot bear alone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:55.87,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The dangers that we keep hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:22:58.54,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,We're all hiding them within
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:01.53,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Standing ready to strike
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.53,0:23:03.96,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The shadow lurking beneath the light
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:08.24,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The muffled sounds coming from my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:13.72,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,They make me feel that I am alive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:15.56,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,It's a sign
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:40.03,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(432.667,122.667)}{\fad(522,1)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:40.03,sign_33934_415_The_Sophie_Serie,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(434.667,228)}{\fad(522,1)}The Sophie Series (Part 2)
